      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAYNE CARGO (1) has some solid form under his belt and proved too classy last time to win by 3 lengths at this track in a handy 19.50 beating Maybe Yes. Has a strong record from box 1, including two wins. In top form and looks a key chance again. IMPERIAL CHOP (7) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 2 lengths at this track in a handy 24.93 beating ARMATREE VIOLET. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Form should stack up. ARMATREE VIOLET (2) broke from the inside draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only 2 lengths (25.08) behind IMPERIAL CHOP at this track. Overdue and is among the main hopes. SHORTY BOY (5) won as punters' elect last time and is a major player again.",
